        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Excellent home delivery service once a week, very early in the morning, ready for my first coffee. Orders are taken by text two days before delivery. A variety of dairy products are available: whipped cream, milk, ice cream, etc. Prices are comparable to grocers, though slightly more expensive, but the service is right at my door, and I'm supporting local businesses. If you happen to meet Joël or his father, they'll always greet you with a smile. I don't want to move far away because I know these home delivery dairy services are rare. Thank you!",
